{"id": 1000717, "slug": "dreams-of-aether", "name": "Dreams of Aether", "name_original": "Dreams of Aether", "description": "<p>Dreams of Aether is a short and sweet cluster of fast-paced, seconds-long microgames! Starring characters from all over Aether, from legendary figures like Zetterburn and Orcane, to the humble Pyrewing and Florpian. Punch, Flap, and Swing your way through the dubiously-canon story, and see how far you can get in endless modes!</p><p>Absa, the Storm Architect from the far-off Tempest Peak, finds herself trapped in an eternal dream world. And things are getting WEIRD! Why can't she wake up? What's with all of these out-of-body experiences? What's this piñata doing here? Why am I asking YOU all these questions?</p><h3>FEATURES:</h3><ul><li><p>5 stages of Aether-flavored microgames!</p></li><li><p>Go for high scores in endless modes of every stage!</p></li><li><p>A new original soundtrack directed by flashygoodness!</p></li><li><p>A smattering of unique artstyles!</p></li><li><p>Laugh at the funny animals interacting! please</p></li><li><p>THE LORE</p></li><li><p>Absa! She's in this one! It's not a fakeout!</p></li><li><p>Dan Fornace-approved, i think?</p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-04-01", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-04-04T10:53:23", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/387/3874f68b94404f51886e4d5460e3f799.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/cd5/cd5fe7c9f8b32a02ed14d60226d950f3.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 55, "added_by_status": {"yet": 7, "owned": 47, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 1, "screenshots_count": 5, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 11, "parent_achievements_count": 11, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count":